note SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only
note Overhead arms "off" and "on": the recorder is composed; it runs only when on is true. Each
note sample starts a fresh recording session (outside the timed loop) so capacity is never reached.
fn armopen n uint on bool to bool
ok = htlname
if on
ok = and ok htinit
end
ret and ok htopen n
end
fn armreset on bool to void
if on
b = htinit
end
end
fn armgo n uint to bool
ret htlaunch n
end
